#   window          W = 834 fs, beta = 0.02, breach run <= 8.4 fs   [INHERITED from the census]
#   moving carrier  rms >= 0.1 bohr, separation excursion >= 0.05 bohr   [INHERITED]
#   work count      >= 200 informative transitions   [INHERITED]
#   dynamism        >= 200 changes, >= 4 distinct readings   [RUNG-1]
#   closure budget  delta* = 0.01   [RUNG-1, a declared judgment from holon.rs CLOSURE_DEFECT_MAX]
